<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="405372286"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1803053632"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Yes! BanG_Dream!"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Poppin'Party"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Yes! BanG_Dream!"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:09.133"><div begin="00:00.985" end="04:33.423"><p begin="00:00.985" end="00:03.168" itunes:key="L1">さあ、飛びだそう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧起飞吧 是的</span></p><p begin="00:03.168" end="00:06.361" itunes:key="L2">明日のドア ノックして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">叩响明天的门扉</span></p><p begin="00:06.361" end="00:11.643" itunes:key="L3">解き放つ 無敵で最強のうた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">解放吧 无敌且最强的歌</span></p><p begin="00:12.746" end="00:14.940" itunes:key="L4">In the name of bang dream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">In the name of BanG_Dream！</span></p><p begin="00:14.312" end="00:15.392" itunes:key="L5">(Bang dream)</p><p begin="00:16.053" end="00:16.483" itunes:key="L6">Yes!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Yes！ BanG_Dream！</span></p><p begin="00:16.669" end="00:16.982" itunes:key="L7">Bang dream</p><p begin="00:17.876" end="00:18.085" itunes:key="L8">(Bang dream)</p><p begin="00:31.054" end="00:33.236" itunes:key="L9">下を向いて歩いていても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使我面向下行走</span></p><p begin="00:33.236" end="00:35.431" itunes:key="L10">星のかけら見つけたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是发现星星的碎片的话</span></p><p begin="00:36.522" end="00:37.625" itunes:key="L11">きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定会在某个时刻</span></p><p begin="00:36.986" end="00:38.078" itunes:key="L12">（きっと）</p><p begin="00:37.451" end="00:38.554" itunes:key="L13">いつか</p><p begin="00:37.927" end="00:39.018" itunes:key="L14">（いつか）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会见到你</span></p><p begin="00:38.403" end="00:41.700" itunes:key="L15">キミに会いにいけるね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你相遇的吧</span></p><p begin="00:41.608" end="00:44.173" itunes:key="L16">授業中の窓の向こうに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">上课时窗户的另一面</span></p><p begin="00:44.173" end="00:46.367" itunes:key="L17">雲の切れ間まぶしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">云朵间的光芒炫目耀眼</span></p><p begin="00:46.367" end="00:47.458" itunes:key="L18">きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们一定会与更加</span></p><p begin="00:46.750" end="00:47.842" itunes:key="L19">（きっと）</p><p begin="00:48.473" end="00:49.336" itunes:key="L20">もっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">遇见晴朗的天空</span></p><p begin="00:48.666" end="00:49.757" itunes:key="L21">（もっと）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">晴朗的天空相遇的 shine</span></p><p begin="00:49.119" end="00:51.220" itunes:key="L22">晴れた空に会えるね</p><p begin="00:52.311" end="00:54.506" itunes:key="L23">Shine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Shine☆</span></p><p begin="00:54.506" end="00:56.700" itunes:key="L24">いつか出会える夢を信じて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信着终有一天会与梦想相遇</span></p><p begin="00:56.700" end="00:58.894" itunes:key="L25">ときどきドキドキときめいてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时心跳加速悸动不已</span></p><p begin="00:59.986" end="01:04.281" itunes:key="L26">ただ胸に秘めている あふれる思いを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是将这快要满溢的思念</span></p><p begin="01:05.384" end="01:07.520" itunes:key="L27">踏みだすキミを待ち続けてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏出步伐继续等待着你</span></p><p begin="01:07.520" end="01:09.715" itunes:key="L28">ときどきドキドキときめいてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有时心跳加速悸动不已</span></p><p begin="01:09.715" end="01:10.806" itunes:key="L29">Catch up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追赶上吧我的愿望 跳出吧你的愿望</span></p><p begin="01:10.156" end="01:11.247" itunes:key="L30">(My wish)</p><p begin="01:11.654" end="01:12.757" itunes:key="L31">Jump out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">jump out！( your wish！)</span></p><p begin="01:11.967" end="01:13.058" itunes:key="L32">(Your wish)</p><p begin="01:12.408" end="01:14.510" itunes:key="L33">Fly high!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拿出勇气 展翅高飞</span></p><p begin="01:14.510" end="01:17.795" itunes:key="L34">勇気だして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拿出勇气来</span></p><p begin="01:14.974" end="01:17.168" itunes:key="L35">(Five, four, three, two, one, bang dream)</p><p begin="01:17.435" end="01:18.527" itunes:key="L36">(Let’s go!)</p><p begin="01:18.329" end="01:20.512" itunes:key="L37">(Five, four, three, two, one, bang dream)</p><p begin="01:20.563" end="01:25.086" itunes:key="L38">さあ、飛びだそう 明日のドア ノックして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧起飞吧 是的</span></p><p begin="01:26.189" end="01:30.566" itunes:key="L39">解き放つ 無敵で最強のうたを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">解放吧 无敌且最强的歌</span></p><p begin="01:30.566" end="01:36.046" itunes:key="L40">キミだけの ホントの声きかせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请让我听到只属于你的真实的声音</span></p><p begin="01:36.046" end="01:40.423" itunes:key="L41">夢とキミが出会う メロディ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在梦中与你相遇的旋律</span></p><p begin="01:38.589" end="01:40.771" itunes:key="L42">(Three, two, one)</p><p begin="01:41.062" end="01:43.233" itunes:key="L43">In the name of bang dream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">In the name of BanG_Dream！</span></p><p begin="01:42.583" end="01:44.777" itunes:key="L44">(Bang dream)</p><p begin="01:43.895" end="01:44.986" itunes:key="L45">Yes!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Yes！ BanG_Dream！</span></p><p begin="01:44.254" end="01:45.346" itunes:key="L46">Bang dream</p><p begin="01:45.706" end="01:46.797" itunes:key="L47">(Bang dream)</p><p begin="01:51.733" end="01:53.113" itunes:key="L48">上を向いて歩いてみたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是试着面向上行走的话</span></p><p begin="01:54.204" end="01:56.387" itunes:key="L49">あの夏を思いだす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就会想起那个夏天</span></p><p begin="01:56.387" end="01:57.478" itunes:key="L50">きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一定会在某个时刻</span></p><p begin="01:56.840" end="01:57.931" itunes:key="L51">（きっと）</p><p begin="01:57.292" end="01:58.384" itunes:key="L52">いつか</p><p begin="01:58.848" end="01:59.847" itunes:key="L53">（いつか）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你一起奔跑的</span></p><p begin="01:58.941" end="02:02.215" itunes:key="L54">キミと走りだせるね</p><p begin="02:02.123" end="02:03.597" itunes:key="L55">教室の机の上に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在教室的桌子上面</span></p><p begin="02:04.688" end="02:06.871" itunes:key="L56">刻まれたキミの夢<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刻着的你的梦想</span></p><p begin="02:06.871" end="02:07.962" itunes:key="L57">きっと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">必定永远</span></p><p begin="02:07.138" end="02:08.229" itunes:key="L58">（きっと）</p><p begin="02:07.683" end="02:08.775" itunes:key="L59">ずっと</p><p begin="02:08.902" end="02:09.994" itunes:key="L60">（ずっと）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又遥远又耀眼</span></p><p begin="02:09.088" end="02:12.374" itunes:key="L61">遠くて眩しいから</p><p begin="02:12.374" end="02:14.557" itunes:key="L62">Fine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">FINE！</span></p><p begin="02:14.905" end="02:17.099" itunes:key="L63">交わした約束が呼んでいる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此交换的约定正在呼唤</span></p><p begin="02:17.099" end="02:19.282" itunes:key="L64">ドキドキステキにときめいてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳加速的美好令人悸动不已</span></p><p begin="02:20.361" end="02:22.730" itunes:key="L65">驚かせてもいいかな？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">使你惊讶也没关系吗？</span></p><p begin="02:22.730" end="02:24.913" itunes:key="L66">そろそろいいのかな？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">差不多就可以了吗？</span></p><p begin="02:24.913" end="02:27.095" itunes:key="L67">きらきら輝くキミを見てる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凝视着闪闪发光的你</span></p><p begin="02:28.163" end="02:30.265" itunes:key="L68">ステキなドキドキがとまらない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美好的心跳让人无法停下</span></p><p begin="02:30.265" end="02:31.356" itunes:key="L69">Catch up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追赶上吧我的愿望 跳出吧你的愿望</span></p><p begin="02:30.671" end="02:31.774" itunes:key="L70">(My wish)</p><p begin="02:31.774" end="02:32.854" itunes:key="L71">Jump out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">jump out！ your wish！</span></p><p begin="02:32.564" end="02:33.667" itunes:key="L72">(Your wish)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展翅高飞 变得炽热</span></p><p begin="02:32.912" end="02:35.106" itunes:key="L73">Fly high!</p><p begin="02:35.106" end="02:38.392" itunes:key="L74">熱くなれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">变得热起来了</span></p><p begin="02:35.466" end="02:37.660" itunes:key="L75">(Five, four, three, two, one, bang dream)</p><p begin="02:38.136" end="02:39.228" itunes:key="L76">(Let’s go!)</p><p begin="02:38.578" end="02:40.760" itunes:key="L77">(Five, four, three, two, one, bang dream)</p><p begin="02:41.062" end="02:45.427" itunes:key="L78">ねえ、飛びたとう 明日の空 めがけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 起飞吧</span></p><p begin="02:46.519" end="02:50.849" itunes:key="L79">解き放つ 無敵に最高のうたを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">解放吧 将那无敌且最棒的歌声</span></p><p begin="02:51.952" end="02:56.341" itunes:key="L80">まっすぐに ホントの声きかせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请直接让我听到你那真实的声音</span></p><p begin="02:56.341" end="03:00.625" itunes:key="L81">夢と歌を結ぶ メロディ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦想与歌声结合起来的旋律</span></p><p begin="02:58.883" end="03:01.078" itunes:key="L82">(Three, two, one)</p><p begin="03:01.380" end="03:02.482" itunes:key="L83">In the name of bang dream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">In the name of BanG_Dream！</span></p><p begin="03:02.842" end="03:03.934" itunes:key="L84">(Bang dream)</p><p begin="03:04.398" end="03:05.489" itunes:key="L85">Yes!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Yes！ BanG_Dream！</span></p><p begin="03:04.781" end="03:05.873" itunes:key="L86">Bang dream</p><p begin="03:05.722" end="03:06.732" itunes:key="L87">(Bang dream)</p><p begin="03:40.757" end="03:42.398" itunes:key="L88">今、夢を撃ち抜く瞬間に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 将梦想贯穿的瞬间</span></p><p begin="03:43.489" end="03:45.683" itunes:key="L89">ドキドキときめくキミを見てる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心跳加速悸动不已 凝视着你</span></p><p begin="03:45.683" end="03:50.049" itunes:key="L90">輝きとキラメキを その手に抱きしめ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用那双手紧紧拥抱着</span></p><p begin="03:50.408" end="03:52.603" itunes:key="L91">こんな日が来ること わかってた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道这样的一天终将到来</span></p><p begin="03:53.694" end="03:55.888" itunes:key="L92">ドキドキときめくキミはいつか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你何时想要心跳加速悸动不已呢</span></p><p begin="03:55.888" end="03:56.991" itunes:key="L93">Catch up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追赶上吧我的愿望 跳出吧你的愿望</span></p><p begin="03:56.376" end="03:57.467" itunes:key="L94">(My wish)</p><p begin="03:56.817" end="03:57.920" itunes:key="L95">Jump out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">jump out！ your wish！</span></p><p begin="03:58.373" end="03:59.453" itunes:key="L96">(Your wish)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展翅高飞 变得较强</span></p><p begin="03:58.826" end="03:59.917" itunes:key="L97">Fly high!</p><p begin="04:01.020" end="04:03.214" itunes:key="L98">強くなれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会变强的</span></p><p begin="04:01.473" end="04:03.655" itunes:key="L99">(Five, four, three, two, one, bang dream)</p><p begin="04:03.040" end="04:04.143" itunes:key="L100">(Let’s go!)</p><p begin="04:03.516" end="04:05.699" itunes:key="L101">(Five, four, three, two, one, bang dream)</p><p begin="04:06.070" end="04:11.550" itunes:key="L102">さあ、飛びだそう 明日のドア ノックして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧起飞吧 是的</span></p><p begin="04:11.550" end="04:17.030" itunes:key="L103">解き放つ 無敵で最強のうたを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">解放吧 那无敌且最强的歌声</span></p><p begin="04:17.030" end="04:21.396" itunes:key="L104">キミだけに ホントの声きかせたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请让我听到</span></p><p begin="04:22.487" end="04:26.875" itunes:key="L105">夢とキミを繋ぐ メロディ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将梦想与你紧紧相连的旋律</span></p><p begin="04:25.122" end="04:26.225" itunes:key="L106">(Three, two, one)</p><p begin="04:27.328" end="04:29.511" itunes:key="L107">In the name of bang dream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">In the name of BanG_Dream！</span></p><p begin="04:28.849" end="04:29.940" itunes:key="L108">(Bang dream)</p><p begin="04:30.405" end="04:31.496" itunes:key="L109">Yes!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Yes！ BanG_Dream！</span></p><p begin="04:30.858" end="04:31.949" itunes:key="L110">Bang dream</p><p begin="04:31.310" end="04:33.423" itunes:key="L111">(Bang dream)</p></div></body></tt>